cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "szl-evidence-core"
abstract: >-
  The primitives under every SZL receipt, extracted once: canonical JSON under
  two named profiles, algorithm-declared digests, SHA3-256 hash-chained receipt
  ledgers ported byte-for-byte from szl-kernels, and the szl.lambda/v1 reference
  vendored unchanged. Hash chains are UNSIGNED_HONEST: tamper-evident, not
  authenticated. Lambda remains Conjecture 1 (open); every verdict is advisory.
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-01"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/szl-holdings/szl-evidence-core"
authors:
